<title>JAPAN: Japan 3-mth T-bill auction lowest price of 99.88.</title>
<headline>Japan 3-mth T-bill auction lowest price of 99.88.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Ministry of Finance said on</p>
<p>Wednesday that its auction of 1.4 trillion yen of three-month</p>
<p>Treasury bills produced the following results:</p>
<p> Lowest price     99.88   Stop rate     0.471 pct</p>
<p> Average price    99.881  Average yield 0.467 pct</p>
<p> Total bids	   5.69631  trillion yen</p>
<p> Accepted Bids	1.3998  trillion yen</p>
<p>Bids accepted at lowest price 29.8601 pct</p>
<p> Issue date	 April 21, 1997</p>
<p> Maturity	   July 22, 1997</p>
</text>
